  "description": "Rasterizes a parsed JetsonPDF document to a multipage TIFF. Reuses the JetsonPDF.Wpf PdfToXamlConverter pipeline (XamlReader.Parse + WPF Measure/Arrange) for layout, captures each page via RenderTargetBitmap, and encodes the multipage TIFF through JetsonPDF.Tiff's managed TiffWriter (no GDI+ dependency). Windows-only because of WPF rasterisation (net8.0-windows + WPF); must be invoked from an STA thread.",
